71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mjo5U7Q9tYgQ7kNvwFmYGbf&_nc_oc=Ado3cMW4oxxIbWzU4d8G0m-Dy7h3dofNF6wunFks-1QH7bgUaavC1zdEpWJE-NWW6uw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNbqHVlPrOWG8BNlfJ05zAUr9Yk680JpZ1MYgzSG1KEkQ&oe=6AE5E8B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hJRx_c0VZPEQ7kNvwFV8VEI&_nc_oc=AdqC6N4ObSIiHEHl5rXFUnlrCdVEPsg4XqSz98AWNYcx_c_K9yKzO2JWPUsin9SHvUo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO-aRm_AZN5xZHbyOJdaKBKxgkidqgWRYJmea4NzqM6NQ&oe=6AE5FB93"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WwEqcYga890Q7kNvwFvh1IT&_nc_oc=AdpDlemLMfqXgSnPRSXbfCwT_584PiJF3b86cmbt8y6ifEfEAuw0A7ulJXtnLSv39IA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPydZMSk5htLGYM67Unvt1Rsl0Tc3QgTw8NwHCc0YaIRQ&oe=6AE5F9DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: